{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39316","headline":"绦州过夏留献郑尚书 · 韦庄","name":"绦州过夏留献郑尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝朝沈醉引金船，不觉西风满树蝉。\n光景暗消银烛下，梦魂长寄玉轮边。\n因循每被时流诮，奋发须由国士怜。\n明月客肠何处断，绿槐风里独扬鞭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}